# radroots_nostrdb

This is the README for `radroots_nostrdb`, which provides nostrdb adapter
primitives for the `radroots` core libraries.

## Overview

 * configuration, filter, ingest, query, and subscription types for
   nostrdb-backed workflows;
 * feature-gated support for the `nostrdb` crate and gift-wrap handling;
 * a `std`-based integration crate with optional async runtime support.

